1
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:13,300
[Footsteps]

2
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:18,180
[REINER] Me? Only thing
I want is to go back home.

3
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,280
That's all I care about now.

4
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,950
[BERTHOLDT] I joined the ranks
hoping for assignment

5
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,520
to the Military Police.

6
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,490
Tucked away in the Interior.

7
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:32,090
What about you?
Why did you sign up?

8
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,430
Why'd I join?

9
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:38,330
I decided I have to kill them.

10
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,500
I won't stop
till every single Titan

11
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:42,400
is dead and rotting.

12
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:45,640
Dead. Every last one.

13
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:02,350
[REINER] You saw what those
monsters are capable of.

14
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:06,920
And you still
want to take them on?

15
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:09,290
I know you've
got what it takes.

16
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:12,730
I can see it in you.
Am I wrong here?

17
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:19,300
[Sniffs]

18
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:26,480
[EREN]
Damn you! You traitors!

19
00:01:26,510 --> 00:01:31,350
[Roars]

20
00:01:39,090 --> 00:01:44,060
♪ Opening Song

21
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,210
Eren!

22
00:03:29,990 --> 00:03:31,690
[MIKASA]
What's wrong with me?

23
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:35,520
Why didn't I slice
their goddamn heads off?

24
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:38,160
That was the perfect chance.

25
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:41,630
Why did I hesitate? Why?

26
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:47,540
[MIKASA]
That was it.

27
00:03:47,570 --> 00:03:50,300
There won't be
another opportunity.

28
00:03:58,110 --> 00:04:00,510
Move! Everyone!

29
00:04:03,250 --> 00:04:05,950
[SOLDIERS groan]

30
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:11,030
It's got Ymir!

31
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:14,530
[grunts] Oh, hell!
She's not the only one!

32
00:04:17,030 --> 00:04:18,370
[KEIJI]
Shit!

33
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,570
[CHRISTA gasps]

34
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:23,940
No. This isn't happening!

35
00:04:23,970 --> 00:04:26,470
How can Bertholdt...?

36
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:40,150
Soldiers! Prepare to attack!

37
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:42,460
The Colossal Titan
doesn't walk away from this!

38
00:04:42,490 --> 00:04:45,230
It's a threat to all mankind!

39
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:48,260
Swarm and terminate!

40
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:12,220
[KEIJI]
Freak's as slow as they say.

41
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:14,220
[GOGGLES] Size is
all he has going for him.

42
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:15,990
[MALE SOLDIER 32F] Compared to
Titans we're usually up against,

43
00:05:16,030 --> 00:05:18,230
this one's a piece of cake!

44
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,630
[MOBLIT]
Simple!

45
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:22,700
[HANGE] He's wide open!
Slice the nape!

46
00:05:24,330 --> 00:05:26,330
[Yells]

47
00:05:26,370 --> 00:05:27,970
[KEIJI]
What the hell?

48
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,470
[MALE SOLDIER 32F]
It's too hot!

49
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:32,370
Argh! All of you fall back!

50
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:40,050
My hand!

51
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:42,050
Water! We need water!

52
00:05:43,420 --> 00:05:45,350
[Gasps]
He's vanishing!

53
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:48,260
I don't know.
Something's different here.

54
00:05:48,290 --> 00:05:50,120
The last time he disappeared,

55
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:53,190
it was more or less
instantaneous.

56
00:05:53,230 --> 00:05:56,100
He's maintaining
his form to emit heat.

57
00:05:56,130 --> 00:05:58,400
I think he's
protecting himself.

58
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:05,140
As long as he generates
steam our rigs are useless!

59
00:06:05,170 --> 00:06:07,540
What, what do we do?

60
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:11,210
Now? Nothing. Except wait.

61
00:06:11,250 --> 00:06:14,380
Squads three and four take
position behind the target.

62
00:06:14,450 --> 00:06:15,980
Rashad has command.

63
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,320
Got it!

64
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:20,490
[HANGE] Squad two, stay put.
Lauda has command.

65
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,490
[LAUDA]
Understood!

66
00:06:22,530 --> 00:06:24,690
[HANGE] How long he
can act like a blast furnace

67
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:26,230
remains to be seen.

68
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:28,660
But he'll come
out of there eventually.

69
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:31,130
When he does,
we'll rush the big bastard.

70
00:06:31,170 --> 00:06:32,900
Listen up.

71
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:35,070
I want you to forget about
taking them alive.

72
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:38,210
Destroy them.
No second thoughts.

73
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,510
You're with me.

74
00:06:42,550 --> 00:06:44,680
Right, squad one, look alive!

75
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:47,720
We've got a date
with the Armored Titan!

76
00:06:49,250 --> 00:06:53,190
Christa! Conny!
Move further back!

77
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:55,920
For now, just
take care of those two.

78
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:58,530
Ymir, she--

79
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:01,530
She's not dead.
It just isn't possible.

80
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:05,270
I know it. Please save her!

81
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:07,130
Don't worry.

82
00:07:07,170 --> 00:07:10,300
[CONNY] Hang on! What about
Reiner and Bertholdt?

83
00:07:10,340 --> 00:07:13,940
They're screwed! Neither one
of them has their ODM gear!

84
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:14,980
I'm begging you,

85
00:07:15,010 --> 00:07:17,680
wherever they are,
bring them back!

86
00:07:17,710 --> 00:07:19,580
[Gasps]

87
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:52,380
[EREN] Reiner.
You lying piece of shit.

88
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:55,580
Going off on what it means
to be a soldier.

89
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,450
Always talking about honor.

90
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:01,990
Played us all for fools, huh?

91
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:05,930
Combat training
must've been a joke to you.

92
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,660
How much were you holding back?

93
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:15,000
And here I took you
to be real stand-up guy.

94
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:18,540
Calm under pressure.
Intensely focused.

95
00:08:18,570 --> 00:08:23,480
The sort of man who puts
his comrades before himself.

96
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:27,310
Damn you. I'd have
given anything in the world

97
00:08:27,350 --> 00:08:30,150
to be half as strong as you.

98
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:33,390
You were my hero.

99
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:35,020
[MIKASA grunts]

100
00:08:37,530 --> 00:08:39,260
[MIKASA]
That did nothing!

101
00:08:43,470 --> 00:08:46,000
He barely flinched
when Eren hit him.

102
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,000
And my blades
don't even make a dent.

103
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:52,070
[Grunts]

104
00:08:52,110 --> 00:08:55,610
He's not like Annie.
His armor's head to toe!

105
00:08:59,250 --> 00:09:01,450
Eren!

106
00:09:05,250 --> 00:09:10,490
[EREN]
Hey, Reiner. Asshole.

107
00:09:10,530 --> 00:09:17,430
I don't know what kind of face
you're making right now...

108
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:20,370
...but I hope you
miserable pieces of shit

109
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,040
are pleased with yourselves.

110
00:09:23,110 --> 00:09:26,970
I bet I could scour through
the history of mankind

111
00:09:27,010 --> 00:09:30,980
and not find anyone
a fraction as evil.

112
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:37,350
[MIKASA grunting]

113
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:39,190
[EREN]
You should be erased.

114
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:43,390
Trash like you
can't be allowed to exist.

115
00:09:43,430 --> 00:09:45,930
What was going
through your head?

116
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,930
You disgust me!

117
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:53,600
Just thinking about your face
makes my insides churn!

118
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:56,140
You make me want to puke!

119
00:09:56,170 --> 00:10:02,040
You're a pest! A revolting,
oversized pest!

120
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:06,250
And pests have to
be exterminated!

121
00:10:20,730 --> 00:10:23,200
[Groans]

122
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:29,230
Hey, take it easy!
That hurt!

123
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,800
We're just sparring.

124
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,570
You're supposed
to hold back a little.

125
00:10:33,610 --> 00:10:35,110
If you want to hold back,
that's your business.

126
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:36,970
I defend myself
assuming you're coming at me

127
00:10:37,010 --> 00:10:39,810
with everything you've got.
Otherwise, what's the point?

128
00:10:39,850 --> 00:10:43,150
Let's remember
I'm the girl. I'm weaker.

129
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:45,280
I have to protect
my frail little body

130
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,880
from the big bad man.

131
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:48,220
What? Ha-ha, Annie.

132
00:10:48,250 --> 00:10:50,520
Very funny. You're a riot.

133
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:53,020
Frail little nothin'.
I'm the one who just got

134
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:55,690
shoved in the dirt, you know.

135
00:10:55,730 --> 00:10:57,630
Good point.

136
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:03,200
[ANNIE] That last move wasn't
about who's stronger, okay?

137
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:05,740
I was using a special
defense technique.

138
00:11:05,770 --> 00:11:07,140
Comes in handy
when your opponent

139
00:11:07,170 --> 00:11:10,140
has a few pounds on you.

140
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:13,280
Trust me. You could
benefit from learning it.

141
00:11:13,310 --> 00:11:14,710
Sure, uh--

142
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:17,210
What do you say we take
a break for now, though?

143
00:11:17,250 --> 00:11:21,590
[EREN groans]

144
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:23,250
[ANNIE grunts]

145
00:11:23,290 --> 00:11:28,830
[EREN groans]

146
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:33,030
Right. That's enough, Annie.
You can let go.

147
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:35,730
Come on. I've barely
shown you how this works

148
00:11:35,770 --> 00:11:37,270
and already you're surrendering?

149
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,140
There's a two-fold benefit here.

150
00:11:39,170 --> 00:11:41,270
Or don't you want to learn
how to talk to women?

151
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:44,270
Fine! Whatever! Just
please stop strangling me!

152
00:11:44,310 --> 00:11:49,010
Ah. So you are interested
in what I can show you.

153
00:11:49,050 --> 00:11:51,020
[REINER groans]

154
00:11:52,890 --> 00:11:56,890
[REINER and EREN groan]

155
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:59,590
Not really sure I wanna
know how you got here.

156
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:01,690
[MIKASA]
Hey, Annie.

157
00:12:01,730 --> 00:12:05,200
Your technique seems
pretty solid.

158
00:12:05,230 --> 00:12:07,100
Teach me.

159
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,900
[ANNIE]
I'm flattered, but...

160
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:14,970
...it's a method
for normal people.

161
00:12:15,010 --> 00:12:18,780
So, why would  you ever need it?

162
00:12:18,810 --> 00:12:23,510
Still, I'm curious to know
if it works on animals.

163
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,650
Let's find out.

164
00:12:25,690 --> 00:12:28,990
This is happening? Oh crap.

165
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:31,860
Hold up! Are these two
actually about to fight?

166
00:12:31,890 --> 00:12:33,020
This is gonna be epic!

167
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:35,130
--Who--? Who do we bet on?
--What d'you mean? Annie.

168
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,690
What? Idiot!

169
00:12:36,730 --> 00:12:38,800
Dinner says Mikasa
wipes the floor with 'er!

170
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:42,570
[REINER] Which one of 'em
you think's gonna win?

171
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,270
Well, I...

172
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:51,210
How should I know?

173
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:02,590
[EREN]
Wait. How did that play out?

174
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:05,790
And why's it coming to me now?

175
00:13:05,830 --> 00:13:10,760
Is this--? Is this my life
flashing before my eyes?

176
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:14,800
So what? Who gives a shit?

177
00:13:14,830 --> 00:13:19,940
It's not like it matters.
Not when I feel like this.

178
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,910
No! Back down!

179
00:13:21,940 --> 00:13:24,140
You can't win in a fistfight!

180
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:25,980
Make a break for the wall!

181
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:29,210
Eren, please! Don't be rash!

182
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:37,550
[EREN TITAN roars]

183
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:39,820
Eren!

184
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:40,960
Oh, no!

185
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:43,230
He's blinded by rage!

186
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:51,170
[ARMIN gasps]

187
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:55,040
[Gasps]

188
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:06,880
What the hell is he doing?

189
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,550
Wait, that-- Holy crap!

190
00:14:09,590 --> 00:14:12,090
That's Annie's technique!

191
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,290
[EREN]
You know what?

192
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:15,790
There's no telling what
you murdering hypocrites

193
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:17,660
were trying to accomplish.

194
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:19,300
But now that I think about it,

195
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:23,970
your master plan seems
to have a few holes in it.

196
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:26,240
Wanna eradicate humanity?

197
00:14:26,310 --> 00:14:30,940
Maybe next time don't teach me
how to kick your ass!

198
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:35,910
It's working!
I've got him locked!

199
00:14:35,950 --> 00:14:38,950
There's still a chance!

200
00:14:40,950 --> 00:14:43,320
[Grunts]
I don't think so!

201
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,620
[EREN TITAN roars]

202
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:48,560
[MIKASA]
Eren!

203
00:14:48,590 --> 00:14:50,660
[EREN]
You're not going anywhere!

204
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:54,100
[EREN TITAN roars]

205
00:14:54,130 --> 00:14:56,200
[Roars]

206
00:14:56,240 --> 00:15:00,270
[Roars]

207
00:15:00,310 --> 00:15:03,740
[Growls]

208
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:08,710
He did it!

209
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:19,990
[ARMIN] Eren!
Can you hear me? Run away!

210
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:21,960
You've got to get
closer to the wall!

211
00:15:21,990 --> 00:15:23,760
They're trying to abduct you!

212
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,700
We can't let them do that!

213
00:15:25,730 --> 00:15:30,070
Trust me. Escape is
our best option!

214
00:15:30,100 --> 00:15:32,770
You say that,
but Armin, come on.

215
00:15:32,810 --> 00:15:34,540
They're not just gonna
let us leave.

216
00:15:34,570 --> 00:15:40,180
[REINER TITAN growls]

217
00:15:40,950 --> 00:15:44,250
Both of you fall back! Now!

218
00:16:01,530 --> 00:16:03,100
[Gasps]

219
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:09,870
[ALL groan]

220
00:16:09,910 --> 00:16:11,980
[Gasps]

221
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:16,850
[KEIJI]
Nice one, Eren! Good call!

222
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:18,780
Looks like he's
in control again.

223
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:21,820
Yeah, but Reiner's
not just gonna let him go.

224
00:16:21,850 --> 00:16:24,920
You're right;
escape's impossible.

225
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,730
[Gasps]

226
00:16:33,770 --> 00:16:35,930
What the hell?

227
00:16:38,570 --> 00:16:41,870
[HANNES] The Colossal Titan.
I knew it!

228
00:16:41,910 --> 00:16:46,240
Why'd he show up here
of all places?!

229
00:16:46,310 --> 00:16:49,310
What's going on with Eren?
Where is he?

230
00:16:49,350 --> 00:16:52,880
Uh. He and the others
are over that way!

231
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:02,730
[HANNES] What? So I take it
that's his Titan form, huh?

232
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:03,890
Listen up, Eren!

233
00:17:03,930 --> 00:17:05,600
If we're going
to get you out of here,

234
00:17:05,630 --> 00:17:07,160
you've got to
buy us some time.

235
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:10,130
Stop Reiner dead in his tracks!

236
00:17:10,170 --> 00:17:11,940
Think you can manage
to break off his leg

237
00:17:11,970 --> 00:17:15,570
with another one
of those joint holds?

238
00:17:15,610 --> 00:17:17,940
Our blades don't
do much good against him.

239
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:20,680
He can't be outmuscled,
but he can be outsmarted

240
00:17:20,710 --> 00:17:22,550
if you play it right.

241
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:25,620
[EREN TITAN]
Mhmm.

242
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,780
[Gasps]

243
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,150
Oooooo!

244
00:17:33,690 --> 00:17:35,560
[ARMIN]
Mikasa! Take my blades.

245
00:17:35,590 --> 00:17:37,960
I want you to use them.

246
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,030
I'm counting on you!

247
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:45,140
[EREN] This is the one time
where running away

248
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:47,670
guarantees victory.

249
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:51,580
You guys are screwed for
letting us see your true colors.

250
00:17:51,610 --> 00:17:53,740
You've backed yourselves
into a corner.

251
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:55,250
[Gasps]

252
00:18:05,290 --> 00:18:06,960
--What the--?
--He's fast!

253
00:18:06,990 --> 00:18:09,490
[REINER TITAN growls]

254
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:14,970
[EREN] Shit! The leg!
Go for the leg!

255
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:19,240
Don't let Reiner
pin you! Get up!

256
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:21,070
Throw him!

257
00:18:21,110 --> 00:18:22,770
[EREN grunts]

258
00:18:24,980 --> 00:18:28,780
Dammit! There's too much
power behind his attack!

259
00:18:31,850 --> 00:18:34,120
Since when is he
so light on his feet?

260
00:18:34,150 --> 00:18:36,990
We're completely
and utterly useless!

261
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:39,160
No. It's not feasible
that his body is

262
00:18:39,190 --> 00:18:41,760
as hard as stone
from head to toe.

263
00:18:41,790 --> 00:18:44,160
He couldn't move as fast
if that were the case.

264
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:46,930
Warriors used to sheathe
themselves in armor.

265
00:18:46,970 --> 00:18:48,770
Way back in the olden days.

266
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,570
They had to leave
certain sections uncovered

267
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,170
for freedom of movement, though;

268
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:56,910
like the armpits and groin
or the spot behind the knee.

269
00:18:59,750 --> 00:19:01,040
[REINER TITAN grunts]

270
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:03,050
[EREN]
I can't dodge this.

271
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,480
[Grunts]

272
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:06,550
Well, if I'm
gonna get slammed...

273
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:08,720
Bring it!

274
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:11,020
There we go!

275
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:14,260
You're mine,
you son of a bitch!

276
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:20,830
[KEIJI]
Yeah! That's how it's done!

277
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:25,200
[EREN] Got him! Now it all
boils down to strength!

278
00:19:27,110 --> 00:19:30,940
[EREN]
Damn it. I'm slipping!

279
00:19:36,850 --> 00:19:40,120
[MIKASA yells]

280
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:42,520
[EREN]
Mikasa.

281
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:44,290
Nice cut!

282
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:49,560
[REINER TITAN groans]

283
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:52,900
[EREN] Try fighting back
minus a leg!

284
00:19:52,930 --> 00:19:55,170
[EREN TITAN growls]

285
00:20:01,010 --> 00:20:02,510
You've got this!

286
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:06,540
Go for it, Eren!
Rip the traitor's head off!

287
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:09,080
Drag him out into the open!

288
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:14,990
[EREN] I can win.
I can beat Reiner.

289
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:17,220
He's going down!

290
00:20:17,260 --> 00:20:23,660
[REINER TITAN grunts]

291
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:29,270
[Growls]

292
00:20:29,300 --> 00:20:31,130
Wha-- What's he--?

293
00:20:31,170 --> 00:20:32,940
Heh. Good luck, pal.

294
00:20:32,970 --> 00:20:35,540
You've got him! Keep it up!

295
00:20:35,570 --> 00:20:42,650
[REINER TITAN growls]

296
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:48,120
[ARMIN]
What's he doing?

297
00:20:48,150 --> 00:20:50,750
Why would he stop here?

298
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:56,130
[Roars]

299
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,790
[Gasps]

300
00:20:57,830 --> 00:21:04,230
[REINER TITAN roars]

301
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:05,700
[Gasps]

302
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:09,910
Everyone be on guard!
He's calling for backup!

303
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:19,650
No visual on
incoming Titans yet.

304
00:21:19,690 --> 00:21:21,850
He ain't got a chance in hell.

305
00:21:21,890 --> 00:21:25,060
Try screaming for help
without a head, asshole!

306
00:21:25,090 --> 00:21:27,690
[MALE SOLDIER 32A]
It's almost off!

307
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:29,930
[CONNY]
Um, I don't like this.

308
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:32,230
Had to be some reason
for that scream.

309
00:21:32,260 --> 00:21:37,330
[Squelching and cracking]

310
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:45,080
What the--?
No, no, no, no, no!

311
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:49,310
[REINER TITAN roars]

312
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:51,650
[Cracking]

313
00:21:54,990 --> 00:21:56,650
[ALL Gasp]

314
00:21:57,690 --> 00:22:00,990
[MALE SOLDIER 32A]
Above you! Look out!

315
00:22:01,030 --> 00:22:02,960
[EREN Gasps]

316
00:22:09,230 --> 00:22:14,240
♪ Closing Song ♪
